From 5c9b8eaaa736363629a21fc89d5512673ddf98c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 11:34:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remaining review items and nested-logic audit leftovers

Spreadsheet items (29-09 / 30-09):
- grids randomize rows AND columns (Randomization.scopes); the answer scale
  is offered once, as "columns"; grid option masking is "Column masking"
- quota target-total box (and every CountInput) is never squeezed, and
  widens with the number typed
- piping dialog: its selects and inputs work inside the rich-text toolbar
  (mousedown no longer cancelled), the caret is kept, flow embedded fields
  are listed, the token is editable, "Show as image" writes |image
- carry-forward / masking offer "Displayed" only when it differs from "All"
- several images / videos under a question (settings.mediaItems, layout,
  alt, reorder, bulk upload); content blocks now render their media
- {{ImageURL|image}} renders a piped URL as a picture (safe URLs only);
  a piped media URL is reported as piped, not unsupported

Audit leftovers:
- editors: older visible-if shown/convertible, List Fill eligible-when,
  row-validation gate
- analytics filter nests 8 levels; interview logic nests and offers NONE
- QSF quota groups -> one multi-cell quota; skip BooleanExpressions;
  Decipher named <condition>s expanded
- embedded IF..THEN..ELSE parsed properly (IF inside THEN, IF (..) THEN)
- calculations read named expressions as 1/0
- SPSS bundle ships <code>_bases.sps with ASKED_<var> filters
- UX styles and animations take `when` (Studio, runtime, Copilot)
- conjoint combination prohibitions (pair AND all/any of more levels, or a tree)

Tests: engine remainingItems, import, designs, exporters, browser
remaining-items-test; mutation-checked.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QAcfUsJLu3R4pYxzaj9SU4
